# Tabler Icons

All UI chrome icons are [Tabler Icons](https://github.com/tabler/tabler-icons), consumed as `@tabler/icons-react`.

- Add or swap icons only in `src/icons.tsx` by wrapping a Tabler export. Pick the closest name from that catalog.
- Components import from `../icons` or `../grok-icons` (aliases). Do not import `@tabler/icons-react` in feature files.
- Do not add Lucide, IconPark, Heroicons, Phosphor, or inline generic SVG icons.

Leave these non-catalog marks alone:

- `GrokBotIcon` — animated live-status robot
- `AgentIcon` — vendor brand marks (Grok / Claude / Kimi / Codex)
- `UsageRing` — usage meter, not a glyph
